{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119512","id":3695587090,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7cRi8S","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119512","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119512.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119512.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119512","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119512/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119512/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119512/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/d3c70217db075847d733d86eed7507d28525ffbc","number":119512,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix repositioning using collisions for CollisionShape3D","user":{"login":"ping-jor","id":212674138,"node_id":"U_kgDODK0mWg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/212674138?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor","html_url":"https://github.com/ping-jor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ping-jor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #118667 \r\n\r\nDescription:\r\nAs detailed in the commit message, this PR resolves an issue where using the \"Reposition Using Collisions\" shortcut (`Shift+G`) on a `CollisionShape3D` caused the shape to snap to itself and move towards the camera abruptly, which is especially noticeable when using the Jolt physics engine.\r\n\r\nThe logic in `_insert_rid_recursive` has been updated to explicitly check for `CollisionShape3D` and `CollisionPolygon3D`, extract their parent's RID (`CollisionObject3D`), and add it to the exclude array.\r\n\r\nSteps to test:\r\n1. Create a `StaticBody3D` (Floor) with a `BoxShape3D` acting as the ground.\r\n2. Create a separate `StaticBody3D` (Object) with a `SphereShape3D` placed in the air above the floor.\r\n3. Select the `SphereShape3D` in the scene tree.\r\n4. Hover the 3D viewport and press `Shift+G`. The sphere now correctly snaps to the floor below it.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg